": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JMhm1wuk", "review": {"bookId": "3300035139", "content": "小的时候，在我妈的科室，这种场景见太多了，这里作者写得好，写得生动。", "bookVersion": 633567360, "range": "6361-6423", "abstract": "病人本来就紧张，更加慌乱，在一堆资料中一通乱翻，嘴里还要自言自语：“脑袋呢，脑袋哪儿去了呢？”张晓刚这个时候看起来就很放松。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "reviewId": "17408780_7JMhm1wuk", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689595707, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300035139", "format": "epub", "version": 937862711, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH/s_cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH.jpg", "title": "张医生与王医生", "author": "伊险峰 杨樱", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "第六章 张医生的门诊", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JMbZXF3W", "review": {"bookId": "3300035139", "content": "历史惊人的巧合，这次疫情大灾也是三年。", "bookVersion": 633567360, "range": "6038-6193", "abstract": "实际上，他们家生活相对来说还好一些，虽然家里人口多，四个男孩，两个女孩，最大的张岐20岁，最小的妹妹只有四五岁，吃饭张嘴的多，但毕竟收入和利息还按时发放，黑市里买得起吃食，不至于亏待了孩子们。我们如今理解的困难时期总像是一个时间点，实际上它持续了将近三年时间，这三年得时刻想着今天吃什么，明天还有什么可吃的……", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7JMbZXF3W", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689590800, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300035139", "format": "epub", "version": 937862711, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH/s_cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH.jpg", "title": "张医生与王医生", "author": "伊险峰 杨樱", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "第三章 张家", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JMbZUKgo", "review": {"bookId": "3300035139", "content": "这是一个圆形广场，环绕的建筑中，有一个日本人修建的二层小楼。在四平战役之前，我爷爷在这里训练和组建了第一批以工人为主干力量的部队。由于工人具备的技术水平较高，结合当时残留在沈阳的装备，成立了解放军早期的炮兵部队。在当时的解放军中是香饽饽，是各个军团争抢的对象。后来大部分牺牲在了四平战役和平静战役。", "bookVersion": 633567360, "range": "5404-5488", "abstract": "孙鸿金提及的“南满医学堂附属奉天医院”位于当时的浪速广场边上，如今叫中山广场，广场中间有一尊毛主席雕像，向着火车站的方向招手。那条通往火车站的路叫中山路，当年叫浪速通。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7JMbZUKgo", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689590800, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300035139", "format": "epub", "version": 937862711, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/48/cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH/s_cpPlatform_eRqVEpkfyddvabPrEes2FH.jpg", "title": "张医生与王医生", "author": "伊险峰 杨樱", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "第二章 走进奉天", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "t